Charles,Alice Springs
Coffs Harbour,Coffs Harbour
Darwin - Central,Darwin
Derby,Derby
Doomadgee,Doomadgee
Dubbo - East,Dubbo
Galiwinku,Galiwinku
Geraldton - Central,Geraldton
Gunbalanya,Gunbalanya
Halls Creek exc.Town Camps,Halls Creek
Hobart,Hobart
Kalgoorlie,Kalgoorlie
Katherine exc. Town Camps,Katherine
Kununurra exc. Town Camps,Kununurra
Lajamanu,Lajamanu
Lismore - North,Lismore
Maningrida,Maningrida
Melbourne - Central,Melbourne
Mildura,Mildura
Minyerri,Minyerri
Mount Isa exc. Camooweal,Mt Isa
Narrabundah - Weston,Charles Perkins House
Newcastle - Inner City,Newcastle
Ngukurr,Ngukurr
