C025,APS-Wide Framework for Indigenous Data and Governance,Commitment,Framework,National Indigenous Australians Agency,Commonwealth Government,Y,x,,,,"An Australian Public Service-wide framework on Governance of Indigenous Data is being developed with non-APS/First Nations partners. The Framework aims to improve the accessibility, relevance, interpretability, and timeliness of government-held data for First Nations peoples. The Framework will also explore the practical intersection between Australian Government objectives and those of the Indigenous Data Sovereignty movement in Australia.",Still in development. Resourcing: Costs are to be absorbed within existing resources Indigenous Specific: Yes Responsible Minister/s: Minister for Finance|Minister for Indigenous Australians Delivery Timeframe: Completion by 2023,National,N/A,N/A,N/A,N/A,,,,x,,,,,,,
C026,Australia's Disability Strategy 2021-2031,Commitment,"Strategy, Action Plan",Department of Social Services,Commonwealth Government,x,,,,,"The Strategy includes a focus on intersectionality and diversity by requiring governments to consider tailoring responses to meet the needs of diverse cohorts, including First Nations people with disability.",Resourcing: $250 million over the lifetime of the strategy Indigenous Specific: No Responsible Minister/s: Minister for Social Services Delivery Timeframe: 2021-2031,National,N/A,N/A,N/A,N/A,,,,,x,x,x,x,x,,
