C055,Enhanced response to addressing sexually transmissible infections (and blood-borne viruses) in Indigenous populations,Commitment,Action Plan,Department of Health and Aged Care,Commonwealth Government,,,,See also the National Strategic approach for an enhanced response to the disproportionately high rates of STI and BBV in Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander people ,,To support the national strategic approach for an enhanced response to the disproportionately high rates of STI and BBV in Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander people ,,National,N/A,N/A,N/A,N/A,,,,,,,x,,,,x
