C058,Fifth National Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander Blood Borne Viruses and Sexually Transmissible Infections (BBV STI) Strategy.,Commitment,Strategy,Department of Health and Aged Care,Commonwealth Government,x,,,,,Fifth National Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander Blood Borne Viruses and Sexually Transmissible Infections (BBV STI) Strategy.,"Resourcing: The Strategy was allocated funding of $20.2 million in the 2019-20 budget. An additional $5.3m was provided in the 2022-23 Budget to extend key projects for a further year while the next Strategy is being developed. Indigenous Specific: Yes Responsible Minister/s: Minister for Health and Aged Care Delivery Timeframe: The Strategy is expected to be published for public consultation in early 2023, and then undergo finalisation processes.",National,N/A,N/A,N/A,N/A,,,,,,,x,,,,
