C095,National Redress Scheme- Targeted Communication Strategy,Commitment,Strategy,Department of Social Services,Commonwealth Government,x,,x,,,"A First Nations specialist agency has been engaged to deliver targeted communications for the National Redress Scheme with the aim to increase awareness of the Scheme and Redress Support Services, and to improve access to redress for First Nations people.","Resourcing: $439,525 (GST inclusive) Indigenous Specific: No Responsible Minister/s: Minister for Social Services Delivery Timeframe: Over an initial 12 month period to December 2023. ",National,N/A,N/A,N/A,N/A,,,,,,,,x,,,
