C103,NDIA First Nations Strategy,Commitment,Strategy,National Disability Insurance Agency,Commonwealth Government,x,,,"In development as at October 2023. Partnership with First Peoples Disability Network. See also, Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander Engagement Strategy",,"Develop an NDIA First Nations Strategy in partnership with the First People's Disability Network to improve the NDIS for First Nations participants. In 2023, the NDIA will be undertaking extensive public engagement, consultation and co-design with First Nations people with disability, participants, communities, representative organisations and service providers, to co-design the new First Nations Strategy.",Resourcing: Costs are to be absorbed within existing resources Indigenous Specific: Yes Responsible Minister/s: Minister for the National Disability Insurance Scheme Delivery Timeframe: Completion by 2023,National,N/A,N/A,N/A,N/A,x,,,,,,x,,,,
