C135,Safe and Supported: Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander First Action Plan 2023-2026,Commitment,Action Plan,Department of Social Services,Commonwealth Government,x,,,"See also, Safe and Supported: National Framework for Protecting Australia’s Children 2021-2031",,"Safe and Supported: the National Framework for Protecting Australia's Children 2021-2031 is the key national mechanism to address Target 12. Its first set of Action Plans, which includes an Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander First Action Plan, were released on 31 January 2023.",Resourcing: $98.5 million was committed (2021-22 MYEFO) to implement four measures. $30 million was also announced in the 2022-23 Federal Budget to support three specific measures. $2.6 million of ongoing funding is available under Safe and Supported. Indigenous Specific: Yes Responsible Minister/s: Minister for Social Services Delivery Timeframe: The first Action Plans will be implemented from 2023 to 2026.,National,N/A,N/A,N/A,N/A,,x,,x,x,,,,x,,
