C164,Buy Australia Plan,Commitment,Strategy,"Department of Finance; Department of Industry, Science and Resources",Commonwealth Government,,,,,,The Buy Australia Plan is a joint measure between the Ministers for Industry and Science and the Department of Finance to get more out of Commonwealth Procurement. The plan will help grow innovative and competitive businesses and support regional Australian communities. DISR is responsible for delivering point 7 of the Plan “support industry sectors through the government’s purchasing power” which has included a scan to identify barriers for First Nations businesses.  ,,National,N/A,N/A,N/A,N/A,,x,,,,x,,,,,
