C184,Social Impact Assessment: Guidance for assessing and managing social impacts of projects ,Commitment,Framework,"Department of State Development, Infrastructure, Local Government and Planning",State Government,,,,The document specifically supplements the requirements of the Coordinator-General’s SIA Guideline.,,Includes a section 4 with a specific focus on Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander peoples. The Supplementary Material is publicly available and is intended to support proponents undertaking a social impact assessment as part of an environmental impact statement (under either the State Development and Public Works Act 1971 or Environmental Protection Act 1994). ,,State,Queensland,N/A,N/A,N/A,,,,,,x,,,,,x
