I033,Restorative Justice Conferences (adults and children),Initiative,Program,"Department of Youth Justice, Employment, Small Business and Training",State Government,,,,,N/A,"Restorative justice is an internationally recognised evidence-based response to criminal behaviour, which views a criminal offence as more than an act of breaking the law. It examines the harm caused to the victim, family relationships and the community.",,Indigenous Area,Queensland,North Queensland,Mt Isa & Surrounds,Mornington Island,,,,,,,,x,,,
