N047,Queensland Closing the Gap Partnership Committee ,Network,Committee,"Department of Treaty, Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander Partnerships, Communities and the Arts",State Government,,x,,,Senior officials from Queensland Government departments and agencies and QATSIC,"To act as the main governance body for the partnership approach to the design, development and coordination of Queensland’s implementation of the National Agreement.",,State,Queensland,N/A,N/A,N/A,x,x,x,x,x,x,x,x,x,x,x
