N057,AusIndustry Outreach Network,Network,Network,"Department of Industry, Science and Resources ",Commonwealth Government,,,,,,"The AusIndustry Outreach Network consists of 27 regional managers who provide on-ground support to connect businesses with government services that enable them to grow and diversify. In particular, regional managers based in Broome, Pinjarra, Darwin, Mackay and Cairns service remote areas and engage with Indigenous businesses in those regions.",,National,N/A,N/A,N/A,N/A,,,x,,,x,,,,,
